{{!
    @template theme_aurora/core/user_menu_metadata

    Sobrescribe core/user_menu_metadata: el botón del menú de usuario muestra el avatar y,
    a su lado, el nombre del usuario (tablero "Header Aurora": avatar + nombre + chevrón).
    El nombre se oculta por debajo de 992 px desde el SCSS del tema.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * metadata - Array of additional metadata to be displayed in the dropdown button.
        * classes - Additional classes to be applied to the content
        * content - The content to be displayed. May/may not have html within it.
    * avatardata - Array of avatars to be displayed.
        * classes - Additional classes to be applied to the content
        * content - The content to be displayed. May/may not have html within it.
    * userfullname - The name of the logged in user

    Example context (json):
    {
        "metadata": [],
        "avatardata": [
            {
                "classes": "current",
                "content": "<img src=\"http://localhost/theme/image.php/boost/core/1617863836/u/f2\" class=\"userpicture defaultuserpic\">"
            }
        ],
        "userfullname": "Admin User"
    }
}}
<span class="avatars">
    {{#avatardata}}
        <span class="avatar {{classes}}">
            {{{content}}}
        </span>
    {{/avatardata}}
</span>
{{#userfullname}}
    <span class="usertext">{{userfullname}}</span>
{{/userfullname}}
{{#metadata}}
    <span class="usertext d-flex me-3">
        <span class="meta d-flex {{classes}}">
            {{{content}}}
        </span>
    </span>
{{/metadata}}
